FACTORY_DEF {*} TeeFactory    FACTORY_NAME { Sampler_B08_Sampled }    INPUT FEATURE_TYPE ___SAMPLED___    OUTPUT { FEATURE_TYPE Sampler_B08_SAMPLED          }
